    "en": "In the past 8 hours the DSH ecosystem added 31 new plugins and 274 stars across official repos, with 538,016 weekly npm downloads; dataelement/dsh-desktop led growth at +74 stars. The official 0.1.7-rc.2 release landed, but the health score is 41 with 12,870 plugins stale for 7+ days, so maintenance activity is worth watching.",
